### ===================== SCORE =====================

### GET top scores
GET http://localhost:8081/api/score/shikaku

### ADD score
POST http://localhost:8081/api/score
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "game": "shikaku",
  "player": "test",
  "points": 500,
  "playedOn": "2026-04-15T12:00:00"
}


### ===================== COMMENT =====================

### GET comments
GET http://localhost:8081/api/comment/shikaku

### ADD comment
POST http://localhost:8081/api/comment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "game": "shikaku",
  "player": "test",
  "comment": "nice game",
  "commentedOn": "2026-04-15T12:00:00"
}


### ===================== RATING =====================

### GET average rating
GET http://localhost:8081/api/rating/shikaku

### GET player rating
GET http://localhost:8081/api/rating/shikaku/test

### SET rating
POST http://localhost:8081/api/rating
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "game": "shikaku",
  "player": "test",
  "rating": 5
}